{"id":"665235","name":"玉米面刀切馒头","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/665235/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"350克"},{"name":"细玉米面","amount":"150克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"120克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"糖","amount":"40克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪油","amount":"10～15克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克玉米面加入120克开水。","img":"images/665235/step_1.png"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665235/step_2.png"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入糖，再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665235/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入2个鸡蛋。","img":"images/665235/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"克面粉。","img":"images/665235/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"克酵母。","img":"images/665235/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀至有大面絮，无干粉的状态。","img":"images/665235/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入15克猪油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665235/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下手揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/665235/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"收入大碗中，盖上保鲜膜。","img":"images/665235/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放温暖处发酵至两倍大（现在温度高，40分钟左右）。","img":"images/665235/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"发酵好了。","img":"images/665235/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"发酵好的面团，排气，再次揉光滑，擀成大面片。","img":"images/665235/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"刷一点水，卷起来。","img":"images/665235/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"切成均匀的小子，整理一下。","img":"images/665235/step_15.png"},{"step":16,"desc":"依次放入蒸锅中，中间留出空隙，二次醒发，馒头生胚拿起来轻飘飘的，按压快速回弹就好了（20分钟左右）。","img":"images/665235/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"时间结束后，凉水上锅，大火，出汽后蒸12～15分钟，再虚蒸3分钟就好了。","img":"images/665235/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"出锅了。","img":"images/665235/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665235/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品图，请品鉴。","img":"images/665235/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}